//  Convert a bpp value and RGBA masks to an enumerated pixel format. This will return
//   `SDL_PIXELFORMAT_UNKNOWN` if the conversion wasn't possible.
//
//  It is safe to call this function from any thread.
//
//  \param bpp — a bits per pixel value; usually 15, 16, or 32.
//  \param Rmask — the red mask for the format.
//  \param Gmask — the green mask for the format.
//  \param Bmask — the blue mask for the format.
//  \param Amask — the alpha mask for the format.
//
//  \returns the SDL_PixelFormat value corresponding to the format masks, or SDL_PIXELFORMAT_UNKNOWN
